@startuml sequence_compose
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title Frequencies Editor - Compose Rows (post-migration)

actor User
participant "<app-frequency-editor>" as Inner
participant "FrequenciesEditorComponent" as Self
participant "<app-data-table>" as DT
participant "MatTableDataSource" as DS

User -> Inner: enter value + type, click Save
Inner -> Self: (save) emits { frequency }
Self -> Self: _local = [..._local, frequency]
Self -> DT: rows getter returns new array
DT -> DS: dataSource.data = rows
DS -> DT: re-render
DT --> User: row appears

User -> DT: click close on a row
DT -> Self: remove({ data: row })
Self -> Self: _local = _local.filter(...)
Self -> DT: rows getter returns new array
DT -> DS: dataSource.data = rows
DS -> DT: re-render
DT --> User: row removed

@enduml
